<title>ITALY: SOCCER-INTERNAZIONALE 3 MONACO 1 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-INTERNAZIONALE 3 MONACO 1 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Internazionale of Italy beat Monaco of France 3-1 (halftime 3-0) in their UEFA Cup semifinal first leg on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Internazionale - Maurizio Ganz 17, 30, Ivan Zamorano 40</p>
<p>Monaco - Victor Ikpeba 71</p>
<p>Red Card: Gilles Grimandi (M) 46</p>
<p>Attendance: 41,000</p>
